Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.47,0:15:56.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加古大哥！没受伤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.93,0:15:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻里 辉夜 你们快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要管我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.99,0:16:03.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么能够抛下加古大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.06,0:16:05.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.56,0:16:07.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快出来 Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.62,0:16:09.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽都等得不耐烦了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.92,0:16:11.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:15.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.62,0:16:18.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.97,0:16:23.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.45,0:16:33.29,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快乐得神采飞扬...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.75,0:16:35.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,都被你们坏了气氛！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.26,0:16:38.91,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,快乐？快乐顶什么用！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.70,0:16:43.45,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,别落了大家神采飞扬的兴致！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.19,0:16:46.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.57,0:16:48.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.88,0:16:52.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.10,0:16:58.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.45,0:17:00.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,停！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:02.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱... 乱暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.34,0:17:07.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就这种程度 怎么可能打倒我这千锤百炼的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.27,0:17:12.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我来讨教！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.28,0:17:15.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱... 暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.87,0:17:19.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,先冲过去！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:22.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱乱乱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.26,0:17:26.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky 没问题吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.89,0:17:27.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:31.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不能冒然靠近 会被盯着打的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.03,0:17:33.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.74,0:17:38.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·棱镜光流
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.74,0:17:38.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Prism Shot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.31,0:17:41.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.89,0:17:45.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.34,0:17:47.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.74,0:17:52.75,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.95,0:17:55.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.71,0:17:59.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,让你们这些软弱者怠慢日常锻炼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:02.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就知道打扮得花枝招展 嬉戏打闹
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.54,0:18:05.14,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙一起嬉闹... 那不是最棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.68,0:18:12.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,人并不是总能够一直笑着的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.37,0:18:16.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,难免会有痛苦的时候 难受的时候 想哭的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:22.58,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那种时候就是要笑面以对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:25.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,为了大家都可以欢笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.40,0:18:29.14,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,要加油 要努力...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.13,0:18:37.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,当笑容致以笑容的时候 我明白了什么是最棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:45.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 我也要像她们那样！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.41,0:18:55.18,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,双色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:18:56.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,红色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:18:56.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Red！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.19,0:18:59.36,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黄色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.19,0:18:59.36,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.98,0:19:05.72,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,守护的力量 飞扬起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.26,0:19:12.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.40,0:19:15.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:17.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,现在能行！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.99,0:19:18.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.99,0:19:19.86,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.11,0:19:23.22,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.05,0:19:25.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:27.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.15,0:19:32.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.72,0:19:34.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱乱乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.04,0:19:37.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing Butterfly 出招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.58,0:19:38.38,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:40.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.40,0:19:43.44,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,全色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.73,0:19:45.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,融合调色盘！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.73,0:19:45.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mix Palette！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.51,0:19:46.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,红色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.51,0:19:46.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Red！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.21,0:19:49.37,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黄色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.21,0:19:49.37,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.81,0:19:52.00,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.81,0:19:52.00,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.51,0:19:54.78,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.51,0:19:54.78,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.36,0:20:02.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,搅拌搅拌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.41,0:20:03.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,色彩填充！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.41,0:20:03.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Colour Charge！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:27.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,光美·绚烂彩虹冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:27.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Precure Titanic Rainbow Attack！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.53,0:20:34.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然开朗
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.53,0:20:34.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.33,0:20:46.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,还不错啊... 就该这样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.74,0:20:49.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要继续锻炼 精进实力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.51,0:20:51.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,弥诺彤彤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.56,0:20:57.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不太清楚发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:21:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 多亏有你 时装秀非常热闹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.23,0:21:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.95,0:21:05.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空可棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:10.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我这种完全不懂什么是时尚的人 都感动到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.55,0:21:12.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是小公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.80,0:21:14.12,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 很厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.49,0:21:17.34,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,时装秀太开心了 超飞扬
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:20.03,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐们是真的厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.58,0:21:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害的是蝶华
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.33,0:21:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:24.65,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.17,0:21:29.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶华上了T台 让要哭出来的小空喜开颜笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.28,0:21:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带起台下的小朋友们一起跳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.98,0:21:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都很快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.65,0:21:39.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,模特儿蝶华是很棒 最适合你的还是保育员吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能当不成最棒的保育员吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.51,0:21:46.03,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！我绝对要当上！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.71,0:21:52.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们一起努力！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:54.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了自己与大家的笑容！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.47,0:21:57.22,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,使出全力飞扬起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.49,0:21:59.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.15,0:22:08.59,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Black哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.15,0:22:08.59,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1055,960)}黑愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.91,0:22:10.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure都20周年了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.80,0:22:12.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,讲真的 这不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.12,0:23:47.32,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.54,0:23:49.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小白 也太怕怪谈了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.00,0:23:51.85,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯丽就没有害怕的东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.02,0:23:52.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,当然没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.14,0:23:55.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？那个布娃娃怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.01,0:23:57.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.13,0:24:00.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.13,0:24:00.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.62,0:24:03.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴与被遗忘的布娃娃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:02:00.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.53,0:02:06.12,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.33,0:02:11.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.67,0:02:19.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.58,0:02:24.54,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.78,0:02:28.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:30.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.27,0:02:34.54,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.15,0:02:39.15,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.21,0:02:41.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:45.70,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:49.64,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:53.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:53.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:55.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:55.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:03:00.80,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:05.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.72,0:03:10.77,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.91,0:03:15.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:18.32,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:26.32,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
